    "subTopic": "Event Loop & Task Queues",
    "question": "When does browser UI rendering occur in relation to the event loop?",
    "answer": "Browser rendering (layout, paint, compositing) occurs after the call stack clears and all microtasks are processed, but before the next macrotask.",
