    "question": "How do you read a file asynchronously in Node.js using the 'fs' module?",
    "answer": "Use fs.readFile(path, encoding, callback) or fs.promises.readFile(path, encoding) with async/await. Asynchronous reading does not block the main thread while waiting for disk I/O.",
