    "question": "What are the six distinct phases of the Node.js event loop?",
    "answer": "1. Timers (setTimeout, setInterval). 2. Pending callbacks (I/O errors). 3. Idle, prepare (internal). 4. Poll (incoming I/O, data). 5. Check (setImmediate). 6. Close callbacks (socket.on('close')).",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "",
    "difficulty": "Intermediate",
    "questionType": "Concept",
    "interviewRound": "Technical Round",
