    "subject": "Node.js",
    "topic": "Node Core & Concurrency",
    "subTopic": "Architecture & Modules",
    "question": "What happens to an ArrayBuffer in the sending thread after being transferred via transferList?",
    "answer": "The sending thread's ArrayBuffer becomes detached and neutered; its byteLength becomes 0 and it can no longer be accessed.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "",
