    "subTopic": "Architecture & Modules",
    "question": "What is SharedArrayBuffer and how does it differ from ArrayBuffer?",
    "answer": "SharedArrayBuffer allows multiple worker threads to read and write the exact same shared memory region concurrently without copying data.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
