    "question": "What are the 5 sub-languages of SQL?",
    "answer": "1. DDL (Data Definition Language). 2. DML (Data Manipulation Language). 3. DQL (Data Query Language). 4. DCL (Data Control Language). 5. TCL (Transaction Control Language).",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
    "questionType": "Concept",
