    "topic": "SQL & Relational Databases",
    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "Which commands belong to DDL (Data Definition Language)?",
    "answer": "CREATE, ALTER, DROP, TRUNCATE, and RENAME. They define and modify database schema structures.",
