    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "Which commands belong to DML (Data Manipulation Language)?",
    "answer": "INSERT, UPDATE, and DELETE. They manipulate data records stored inside tables.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "INSERT INTO users (name) VALUES ('Alice');",
