    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "Which commands belong to DCL (Data Control Language)?",
    "answer": "GRANT and REVOKE. They manage user permissions and access rights on database objects.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "GRANT SELECT ON users TO reader_role;",
