    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "Which commands belong to TCL (Transaction Control Language)?",
    "answer": "COMMIT, ROLLBACK, and SAVEPOINT. They manage transactions to ensure ACID compliance.",
