    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "How do you insert multiple rows in a single SQL statement (bulk insert)?",
    "answer": "Chain multiple value sets separated by commas: INSERT INTO table (col) VALUES (val1), (val2), (val3);.",
