    "question": "What does the GROUP BY clause do in SQL?",
    "answer": "GROUP BY groups rows that share the same values in specified columns into summary rows (e.g. calculate total sales per department).",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "SELECT department, COUNT(*), AVG(salary)\nFROM employees\nGROUP BY department;",
