    "question": "What are the requirements for First Normal Form (1NF)?",
    "answer": "1. Each column must hold atomic (indivisible) values (no arrays or comma-separated lists). 2. Each record must have a unique identifier (Primary Key). 3. No repeating groups of columns.",
