    "question": "What does EXPLAIN (or EXPLAIN ANALYZE) do in SQL?",
    "answer": "EXPLAIN displays the execution plan chosen by the query optimizer (showing table scans, index lookups, join types, and estimated row costs). ANALYZE actually executes the query and shows real runtime stats.",
