    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "Why is 'GROUP BY 1, 2' considered bad practice in production code?",
    "answer": "If someone changes the column order in the SELECT list, the grouping criteria silently changes without syntax error, causing subtle data bugs.",
