    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "How do you find the Nth highest salary using LIMIT / OFFSET?",
    "answer": "SELECT DISTINCT salary FROM employees ORDER BY salary DESC LIMIT 1 OFFSET N-1;",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "-- For 3rd highest salary (N=3, offset=2):\nSELECT DISTINCT salary\nFROM employees\nORDER BY salary DESC\nLIMIT 1 OFFSET 2;",
