    "question": "Why is DISTINCT necessary when finding Nth highest salary?",
    "answer": "Multiple employees may share the exact same top salaries (e.g. three employees earn 100k). Without DISTINCT, OFFSET 1 returns 100k again instead of the second unique salary.",
