    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "Why does COUNT(CASE WHEN condition THEN 1 END) work without an ELSE branch?",
    "answer": "When the condition is false, CASE defaults to NULL. COUNT ignores NULLs, so only matching rows are counted!",
