    "subject": "SQL",
    "topic": "SQL & Relational Databases",
    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "Window Coding: Write a query to compute a 7-day moving average of daily active users.",
    "answer": "SELECT date, AVG(dau) OVER (ORDER BY date ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW) AS moving_avg_7d FROM daily_metrics;",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "SELECT date, active_users,\n  AVG(active_users) OVER (\n    ORDER BY date\n    ROWS BETWEEN 6 PRECEDING AND CURRENT ROW\n  ) AS moving_avg_7d\nFROM daily_metrics;",
