    "subject": "SQL",
    "topic": "SQL & Relational Databases",
    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "When should Materialized Views be used?",
    "answer": "For expensive, slow analytical aggregation queries on large tables where real-time freshness is not required and data can be refreshed periodically.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "",
