    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "What is Denormalization and why is it used in production systems?",
    "answer": "Deliberately introducing controlled redundancy into a normalized schema to reduce expensive joins and improve read performance in read-heavy applications.",
