    "subject": "SQL",
    "topic": "SQL & Relational Databases",
    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "What are the major trade-offs of Denormalization?",
    "answer": "Faster read queries, but slower writes, increased storage consumption, and higher risk of data inconsistency when updating duplicate fields.",
