    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "How do you rewrite 'WHERE YEAR(created_at) = 2026' to allow index usage?",
    "answer": "Use a date range: WHERE created_at >= '2026-01-01' AND created_at < '2027-01-01'.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "-- Index-friendly range query:\nWHERE created_at >= '2026-01-01 00:00:00'\n  AND created_at < '2027-01-01 00:00:00'",
