    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "What is a Partial Index (Filtered Index)?",
    "answer": "An index built over a subset of rows satisfying a WHERE condition (e.g. index only active users), saving disk space and speeding up targeted queries.",
