    "topic": "SQL & Relational Databases",
    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "What is a Non-Repeatable Read?",
    "answer": "Transaction A reads a row, Transaction B updates or deletes that row and commits, and Transaction A re-reads the row obtaining different data.",
