    "subTopic": "Queries, Joins, Aggregation & Design",
    "question": "What happens if a NOT IN list contains a NULL value in SQL?",
    "answer": "If the subquery or list contains NULL, 'NOT IN' evaluates to UNKNOWN and returns ZERO rows! Use NOT EXISTS or filter out NULLs.",
