    "question": "What is a Recursive CTE and when is it used?",
    "answer": "A CTE that references itself to traverse hierarchical or tree-structured data (organizational charts, bill-of-materials, graph paths).",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "WITH RECURSIVE OrgChart AS (\n  SELECT id, name, manager_id, 1 AS level FROM employees WHERE manager_id IS NULL\n  UNION ALL\n  SELECT e.id, e.name, e.manager_id, o.level + 1\n  FROM employees e JOIN OrgChart o ON e.manager_id = o.id\n)\nSELECT * FROM OrgChart;",
