    "question": "What is the difference between COLLSCAN and IXSCAN in MongoDB explain() plans?",
    "answer": "COLLSCAN (Collection Scan) reads every document on disk sequentially (slow, O(N)). IXSCAN (Index Scan) seeks directly through index keys (fast, O(log N)).",
