    "answer": "The probability is 1/6 (or ~16.67%). Total outcomes = 6 * 6 = 36. Favorable outcomes for sum 7: (1,6), (2,5), (3,4), (4,3), (5,2), (6,1) = 6 outcomes. Probability = 6 / 36 = 1/6.",
