    "shortExplanation": "1) Total engineers = 40 + 60 = 100. 2) Engineers leaving Branch A = 10% of 40 = 4. 3) Engineers leaving Branch B = 20% of 60 = 12. 4) Total engineers who left = 4 + 12 = 16. 5) Overall attrition rate = (16 / 100) * 100 = 16%.",
