    "subTopic": "Aptitude & Data Interpretation",
    "question": "What is the basic formula for Profit and Loss percentage?",
    "answer": "Profit = SP - CP. Profit% = (Profit / CP) * 100. Loss = CP - SP. Loss% = (Loss / CP) * 100. Both are strictly calculated over Cost Price (CP).",
