    "question": "What are the formulas for Downstream Speed and Upstream Speed in boats and streams?",
    "answer": "Downstream Speed (D) = B + S (boat + stream). Upstream Speed (U) = B - S (boat - stream). Boat speed in still water = (D + U) / 2. Stream speed = (D - U) / 2.",
