    "subject": "Aptitude",
    "topic": "Quantitative & Verbal Aptitude",
    "subTopic": "Aptitude & Data Interpretation",
    "question": "What is the formula for Compound Interest (CI) compounded annually?",
    "answer": "Amount A = P * (1 + R/100)^T. Compound Interest CI = A - P = P * [(1 + R/100)^T - 1].",
