    "answer": "8 minutes. Let total capacity = LCM(24, 32) = 96 units. A's rate = 4 units/min, B's rate = 3 units/min. Pipe A works the entire 18 minutes: 18 * 4 = 72 units. Remaining work for B = 96 - 72 = 24 units. Time B was open = 24 / 3 = 8 minutes.",
