    "question": "A man can row 9 km/h in still water. It takes him twice as long to row up as to row down the river. What is the speed of the stream?",
    "answer": "3 km/h. Let stream speed = s. Downstream = 9 + s, Upstream = 9 - s. Time up = 2 * Time down -> D/(9 - s) = 2 * D/(9 + s) -> 9 + s = 2(9 - s) = 18 - 2s -> 3s = 9 -> s = 3 km/h.",
