    "subTopic": "Aptitude & Data Interpretation",
    "question": "A sum of money placed at compound interest doubles itself in 4 years. In how many years will it become 8 times itself?",
    "answer": "12 years. 8 = 2^3. If it doubles (2^1) in 4 years, it becomes 2^3 in 3 * 4 = 12 years.",
