    "subTopic": "Aptitude & Data Interpretation",
    "question": "The ratio of father's age to son's age is 7:2. Five years ago, the ratio was 6:1. What is the father's present age?",
    "answer": "35 years. Present ages = 7x and 2x. (7x - 5)/(2x - 5) = 6/1 -> 7x - 5 = 12x - 30 -> 5x = 25 -> x = 5. Father's age = 7 * 5 = 35 years. Son's age = 10 years.",
