    "question": "If 'P + Q' means P is the father of Q, 'P - Q' means P is the sister of Q, and 'P * Q' means P is the brother of Q, what does 'A * B - C' mean?",
    "answer": "A is the maternal/paternal uncle of C (A is the brother of C's sister/brother, so A is the brother of B). A is brother of B, and B is sister of C. Therefore, A is the brother of C.",
