    "question": "What key edge cases should a fresher always clarify before coding an interview problem?",
    "answer": "Always clarify: 1) Can the input be empty, null, or undefined? 2) Can numbers be negative, zero, or floating point? 3) Can strings contain spaces, punctuation, or mixed case? 4) What should be returned if no valid answer exists? 5) How large can n be (time complexity constraints)?",
