    "question": "What is an Anagram and how do you check if two strings are anagrams in O(n) time?",
    "answer": "Two strings are anagrams if they contain the exact same characters with identical frequencies. Count frequencies using a hash map or 26-element array in O(n) time.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function isAnagram(s, t) {\n  if (s.length !== t.length) return false;\n  const count = {};\n  for (const c of s) count[c] = (count[c] || 0) + 1;\n  for (const c of t) {\n    if (!count[c]) return false;\n    count[c]--;\n  }\n  return true;\n}",
    "difficulty": "Easy",
