    "codeExample": "const dummy = new ListNode(0);\nlet tail = dummy;\nwhile (l1 && l2) {\n  if (l1.val < l2.val) { tail.next = l1; l1 = l1.next; }\n  else { tail.next = l2; l2 = l2.next; }\n  tail = tail.next;\n}\ntail.next = l1 || l2;\nreturn dummy.next;",
