    "question": "Explain the Fibonacci sequence problem and compare its naive recursion with DP.",
    "answer": "Naive recursion solves fib(n) = fib(n-1) + fib(n-2) with O(2^n) time due to duplicate subtrees. Memoized or Tabulated DP stores results and computes each value once in O(n) time and O(1) space.",
