    "question": "What is the Container With Most Water problem and its two-pointer solution?",
    "answer": "Pointers at both ends of array. Calculate area = (r - l) * min(h[l], h[r]). Move the pointer pointing to the SHORTER height inward to potentially find a taller line.",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "let l = 0, r = height.length - 1, maxArea = 0;\nwhile (l < r) {\n  const area = (r - l) * Math.min(height[l], height[r]);\n  maxArea = Math.max(maxArea, area);\n  if (height[l] < height[r]) l++;\n  else r--;\n}",
