    "question": "Find the missing number in an array containing numbers 1 to n with one missing number.",
    "answer": "Calculate expected sum of numbers 1 to n using formula: total = (n * (n + 1)) / 2. Subtract actual sum of array elements. The difference is the missing number. Runs in O(n) time and O(1) space.",
