    "answer": "Problem: Reverse an array in place using two pointers.\nInput: arr = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\nOutput: [5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\nExample: reverseArray([1, 2]) returns [2, 1]\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function reverseArray(arr) {\n  let left = 0, right = arr.length - 1;\n  while (left < right) {\n    [arr[left], arr[right]] = [arr[right], arr[left]];\n    left++;\n    right--;\n  }\n  return arr;\n}",
