    "answer": "Problem: Return indices of two numbers that add up to target.\nInput: nums = [2, 7, 11, 15], target = 9\nOutput: [0, 1]\nExample: twoSum([3, 2, 4], 6) returns [1, 2]\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(n)",
