    "subTopic": "Array, String, Matrix, Polyfill & Algorithm Implementations",
    "question": "Coding: Add Binary Strings without BigInt.",
    "answer": "Problem: Given two binary strings, return their sum as a binary string.\nInput: a = '11', b = '1'\nOutput: '100'\nTime Complexity: O(max(N, M))\nSpace Complexity: O(max(N, M))",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function addBinary(a, b) {\n  let i = a.length - 1, j = b.length - 1, carry = 0, res = [];\n  while (i >= 0 || j >= 0 || carry) {\n    let sum = carry;\n    if (i >= 0) sum += Number(a[i--]);\n    if (j >= 0) sum += Number(b[j--]);\n    res.push(sum % 2);\n    carry = Math.floor(sum / 2);\n  }\n  return res.reverse().join('');\n}",
