    "question": "Coding: Reverse a Singly Linked List iteratively.",
    "answer": "Problem: Reverse a singly linked list in-place and return new head.\nInput: 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5 -> null\nOutput: 5 -> 4 -> 3 -> 2 -> 1 -> null\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function reverseList(head) {\n  let prev = null, curr = head;\n  while (curr) {\n    const next = curr.next;\n    curr.next = prev;\n    prev = curr;\n    curr = next;\n  }\n  return prev;\n}",
