    "answer": "Problem: Design stack that supports push, pop, top, and retrieving minimum in O(1).\nTime Complexity: O(1) all ops\nSpace Complexity: O(n)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "class MinStack {\n  constructor() { this.stack = []; this.minStack = []; }\n  push(val) {\n    this.stack.push(val);\n    const min = this.minStack.length ? Math.min(val, this.minStack[this.minStack.length - 1]) : val;\n    this.minStack.push(min);\n  }\n  pop() { this.stack.pop(); this.minStack.pop(); }\n  top() { return this.stack[this.stack.length - 1]; }\n  getMin() { return this.minStack[this.minStack.length - 1]; }\n}",
