    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function mySqrt(x) {\n  if (x < 2) return x;\n  let l = 1, r = Math.floor(x / 2), ans = 1;\n  while (l <= r) {\n    const mid = Math.floor((l + r) / 2);\n    if (mid * mid <= x) { ans = mid; l = mid + 1; }\n    else r = mid - 1;\n  }\n  return ans;\n}",
