    "question": "Coding: Flipping an Image — horizontal flip followed by inversion.",
    "answer": "Problem: Given binary matrix, flip horizontally and invert (0->1, 1->0).\nInput: image = [[1,1,0],[1,0,1],[0,0,0]]\nOutput: [[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[1,1,1]]\nTime Complexity: O(n^2)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) in-place",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function flipAndInvertImage(image) {\n  const n = image.length;\n  for (const row of image) {\n    let l = 0, r = n - 1;\n    while (l <= r) {\n      const temp = row[l] ^ 1;\n      row[l] = row[r] ^ 1;\n      row[r] = temp;\n      l++; r--;\n    }\n  }\n  return image;\n}",
