    "question": "Coding: Maximum Average Subarray I.",
    "answer": "Problem: Find contiguous subarray of length k with maximum average value.\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function findMaxAverage(nums, k) {\n  let sum = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < k; i++) sum += nums[i];\n  let maxSum = sum;\n  for (let i = k; i < nums.length; i++) {\n    sum += nums[i] - nums[i - k];\n    maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, sum);\n  }\n  return maxSum / k;\n}",
