    "answer": "Problem: Return smallest sorted list of ranges covering all numbers in sorted unique array.\nInput: nums = [0,1,2,4,5,7]\nOutput: ['0->2','4->5','7']\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(n)",
