    "question": "Coding: Degree of an Array.",
    "answer": "Problem: Find smallest contiguous subarray with same degree as array.\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(n)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function findShortestSubArray(nums) {\n  const count = {}, first = {}, last = {};\n  let deg = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n    const x = nums[i];\n    if (first[x] === undefined) first[x] = i;\n    last[x] = i;\n    count[x] = (count[x] || 0) + 1;\n    deg = Math.max(deg, count[x]);\n  }\n  let minLen = nums.length;\n  for (const x in count) {\n    if (count[x] === deg) minLen = Math.min(minLen, last[x] - first[x] + 1);\n  }\n  return minLen;\n}",
