    "subTopic": "Array, String, Matrix, Polyfill & Algorithm Implementations",
    "question": "Coding: Convert Sorted Array to Binary Search Tree with minimum height.",
    "answer": "Problem: Build height-balanced BST from sorted ascending array.\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(log n)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function sortedArrayToBST(nums) {\n  const build = (l, r) => {\n    if (l > r) return null;\n    const mid = Math.floor((l + r) / 2);\n    const root = { val: nums[mid], left: null, right: null };\n    root.left = build(l, mid - 1);\n    root.right = build(mid + 1, r);\n    return root;\n  };\n  return build(0, nums.length - 1);\n}",
