    "question": "Coding: Perfect Number check (sum of proper divisors equals number).",
    "answer": "Problem: Check if positive integer equals sum of all its positive divisors except itself.\nInput: num = 28\nOutput: true (1 + 2 + 4 + 7 + 14 = 28)\nTime Complexity: O(sqrt(n))\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function checkPerfectNumber(num) {\n  if (num <= 1) return false;\n  let sum = 1;\n  for (let i = 2; i * i <= num; i++) {\n    if (num % i === 0) {\n      sum += i;\n      if (i * i !== num) sum += num / i;\n    }\n  }\n  return sum === num;\n}",
