    "question": "Coding: Product of array except self without division.",
    "answer": "Problem: Return array where output[i] equals product of all elements except nums[i].\nInput: nums = [1, 2, 3, 4]\nOutput: [24, 12, 8, 6]\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) auxiliary",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function productExceptSelf(nums) {\n  const n = nums.length, res = new Array(n).fill(1);\n  for (let i = 1; i < n; i++) res[i] = res[i - 1] * nums[i - 1];\n  let post = 1;\n  for (let i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    res[i] *= post;\n    post *= nums[i];\n  }\n  return res;\n}",
