    "answer": "Problem: Find minimum element in rotated sorted array of unique elements.\nInput: nums = [3, 4, 5, 1, 2]\nOutput: 1\nTime Complexity: O(log n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function findMin(nums) {\n  let l = 0, r = nums.length - 1;\n  while (l < r) {\n    const mid = Math.floor((l + r) / 2);\n    if (nums[mid] > nums[r]) l = mid + 1;\n    else r = mid;\n  }\n  return nums[l];\n}",
