    "answer": "Problem: Return array of all unique triplets [nums[i], nums[j], nums[k]] summing to 0.\nInput: nums = [-1, 0, 1, 2, -1, -4]\nOutput: [[-1, -1, 2], [-1, 0, 1]]\nTime Complexity: O(n^2)\nSpace Complexity: O(1) auxiliary",
