    "answer": "Problem: Merge all overlapping intervals and return non-overlapping intervals.\nInput: intervals = [[1, 3], [2, 6], [8, 10], [15, 18]]\nOutput: [[1, 6], [8, 10], [15, 18]]\nTime Complexity: O(n log n)\nSpace Complexity: O(n)",
