    "answer": "Problem: Compress chars array in-place: ['a','a','b','b','c'] -> ['a','2','b','2','c'].\nInput: chars = ['a', 'a', 'b', 'b', 'c', 'c', 'c']\nOutput: 6 (['a', '2', 'b', '2', 'c', '3'])\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function compress(chars) {\n  let write = 0, i = 0;\n  while (i < chars.length) {\n    let j = i;\n    while (j < chars.length && chars[j] === chars[i]) j++;\n    chars[write++] = chars[i];\n    const count = j - i;\n    if (count > 1) {\n      for (const c of String(count)) chars[write++] = c;\n    }\n    i = j;\n  }\n  return write;\n}",
