    "answer": "Problem: Retries async fn up to maxRetries times before throwing last error.\nTime Complexity: O(maxRetries * fnTime)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "async function retry(fn, maxRetries = 3, delay = 1000) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < maxRetries; i++) {\n    try {\n      return await fn();\n    } catch (err) {\n      if (i === maxRetries - 1) throw err;\n      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, delay));\n    }\n  }\n}",
