    "question": "Coding: Calculate Power x^n (Binary Exponentiation).",
    "answer": "Problem: Implement pow(x, n) in O(log n) time.\nTime Complexity: O(log n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function myPow(x, n) {\n  if (n === 0) return 1;\n  let exp = Math.abs(n), base = x, res = 1;\n  while (exp > 0) {\n    if (exp % 2 === 1) res *= base;\n    base *= base;\n    exp = Math.floor(exp / 2);\n  }\n  return n < 0 ? 1 / res : res;\n}",
