    "question": "Coding: Minimum Path Sum in 2D Grid.",
    "answer": "Problem: Find path from top-left to bottom-right minimizing sum of numbers along path.\nTime Complexity: O(m * n)\nSpace Complexity: O(n)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function minPathSum(grid) {\n  const m = grid.length, n = grid[0].length;\n  const dp = new Array(n).fill(Infinity);\n  dp[0] = 0;\n  for (let r = 0; r < m; r++) {\n    dp[0] += grid[r][0];\n    for (let c = 1; c < n; c++) {\n      dp[c] = grid[r][c] + Math.min(dp[c], dp[c - 1]);\n    }\n  }\n  return dp[n - 1];\n}",
