    "question": "Coding: Trapping Rain Water using two pointers.",
    "answer": "Problem: Compute total trapped water after raining given elevation map.\nInput: height = [0, 1, 0, 2, 1, 0, 1, 3, 2, 1, 2, 1]\nOutput: 6\nTime Complexity: O(n)\nSpace Complexity: O(1)",
    "shortExplanation": "",
    "codeExample": "function trap(height) {\n  let l = 0, r = height.length - 1, lMax = 0, rMax = 0, total = 0;\n  while (l < r) {\n    if (height[l] < height[r]) {\n      if (height[l] >= lMax) lMax = height[l];\n      else total += lMax - height[l];\n      l++;\n    } else {\n      if (height[r] >= rMax) rMax = height[r];\n      else total += rMax - height[r];\n      r--;\n    }\n  }\n  return total;\n}",
