    "topic": "HTTP & Browsers",
    "subTopic": "Web Architecture & Security",
    "question": "How do you prevent open redirect vulnerabilities?",
    "answer": "Validate redirect targets against an allowlist of approved domains or ensure the redirect path is strictly a relative path starting with `/` (and not `//` which represents protocol-relative external URLs).",
