    "answer": "Used schema validation libraries such as Joi or Zod inside a validation middleware. Before the request reaches the controller, the middleware validates req.body against a strict schema (e.g. required email format, password min length). If validation fails, it immediately returns a 400 Bad Request with structured error messages, preventing malformed data from touching the database.",
