    "answer": "Used embedding for data that is tightly coupled, bounded in size, and always read together (e.g., shipping address inside a user document, items inside an immutable historical order). Used referencing (ObjectId with ref) for data that grows unbounded or is queried independently (e.g., reviews for a product, comments on a post) to avoid exceeding the 16MB document limit.",
