    "question": "What do you do if you realize you cannot complete an assigned task on time?",
    "answer": "Communicate early as soon as the delay is foreseen, not at the deadline hour. 1) Notify your lead or team with a clear explanation of what is causing the delay. 2) Provide the current completion status. 3) Propose solutions (e.g. shipping a partial working version, pairing with a teammate, or an updated realistic completion time).",
